(= GuardType v0, Int ... do something with v2 into this: v0:Object = ... v1:Int = GuardType v0,) Tj
T*
(Int ... do something with v1 v2:Int = GuardType v1, Int ... do something with v2 Note that the) Tj
T*
(second use of v0 has been turned into v1 . This is important because a later constant-folding) Tj
T*
(pass can observe that the input v1 of GuardType v1, Int is already an Int and can therefore) Tj
T*
(replace all uses of v2 with v1 and delete the guard. Because in this local version we make a) Tj
